{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The debut game book by Kudomos; an epic adventure of sorcery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/extras/23807f1085df91c442a4163c04ca524d.poster.avif?t=1747883890\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/extras/23807f1085df91c442a4163c04ca524d.webm?t=1747883890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/extras/23807f1085df91c442a4163c04ca524d.mp4?t=1747883890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Playing as a Gilded Sky acolyte, and issued a quest upon graduation from the Sky Guild, you'll navigate the high fantasy landscape steeped in dungeons and dragons lore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2d6 dice narrative adventure game book, you face up to skill, luck or stamina challenges with the roll of the die: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/extras/c04d4a6b0b1e6083a825d83e0a14371b.poster.avif?t=1747883890\" width=780 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/extras/c04d4a6b0b1e6083a825d83e0a14371b.webm?t=1747883890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/extras/c04d4a6b0b1e6083a825d83e0a14371b.mp4?t=1747883890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find creatures and puzzles along the way, as you are presented with the ever expansive quest of the Ancients. In a self-motivated journey the avatar must decide on not only their own fate, but that of the entire realm in this story rich, &amp; choice rich adventure featuring over 40 unique and gory deaths should you choose unwisely.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Master of Fates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647380/b8467cebbfd3576718050afa4b8c4de4ea38800b.jpg"},{"name":"Dice Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647380/31a0a0e26d172f58b466afb34a1a6a82945d6500.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Roller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647380/a25f6beee886dc1a2a900760413bdb27980b0358.jpg"},{"name":"Audience to a Bard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647380/351b284203e44431239dcfc9186c29cc20848748.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647380/f6dc2c14db4f0c033dea4c4b2605494131f318fa.jpg"},{"name":"Deathless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647380/342afe704c75ba9464474df8d9ffb1359a378ff1.jpg"},{"name":"Glutton for Punishment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647380/355b29a9dfb9d1acaf33c10c72d40ebe918744b1.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647380?t=1747883890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/42f2c37c3bf404abc9c2b727bd924f99acee7a9a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747883890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/b1f6f87360574fea9f90d085041a62fb2f8a407c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747883890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647380/b1f6f87360574fea9f90d085041a62fb2f8a407c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747883890","categories":[{"descriptio